_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQWOFLhjG9NkDqcxFXAbQS4NJZmM0onQQBjaY73euJqQ&oe=6AF8A7F3"}, {"file_name": "2_Cove_TwinSwords.png", "id": "4439448732976061", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303707_4439448762976058_4627848642593157065_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fVohOroY494Q7kNvwFvJOFI&_nc_oc=Adq21TIQtIoINEGioSikbwNFgornbzFYW1Ca9yPuO7D5P7r7fsbGlf7PwTR-g_0DJB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRoxg2EMczvxA00dxp5624doaRBCUUQzulUn02O17H-qg&oe=6AF895A8"}, {"file_name": "4_DressingRoom_Colours.png", "id": "1518496620015542", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/759751223_1518496626682208_8119095066219897492_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D0iDYqc_vJUQ7kNvwEeK7-3&_nc_oc=AdrACnR2VkL5oz8cMusfUA2oORjrrCAwEKCL-G_eVbqEek8ZKvy6T_-l4j4rqcV9o8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcx9tgovhSSxIqsKR95EXHPKPqFLFdmlmge-MKvyRbMw&oe=6AF888EE"}, {"file_name": "5_Gym_Sparring.png", "id": "2269904197138353", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/798771582_2269904200471686_2715835721007147568_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HGw126yQNVsQ7kNvwGUUHbW&_nc_oc=Adr2IXSBPD2o701CS8rXzYOIP-MQ1lirdhpDhlGukcuw85oQB9JbwE9ln6pxcDo97S4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJzYGoae8l4V3LTn1pcW-BBjUBupX7ePy-R41OVA9Wdw&oe=6AF8AAE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fists and Fable VR", "keywords": ["fighting", "boxing", "mma", "fight", "fitness"], "long_description": "A single-player VR fighting game inspired by backyard brawls and anything-goes street fights.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a TRAIN IN THE GYM\nYour gym is your main menu. Hammer the heavy bags, work the speed bag and spar in the cage while other fighters train around you.\n\n\ud83d\udc4a SEVEN FIGHTERS\nEach with his own power. Rook, a classic Muay Thai fighter, pushes with the force and throws energy balls. The Gun Fighter has a pistol, grenades and a baton. The White Knight fights with sword and shield, Eclipse with magic bolts and a ward, Red Eyes with rage kicks and twin swords, the Cage Fighter with a power surge, and Ventress, a pirate archer, with her bow and fire arrows.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 CLIMB THE LADDER\nPick a fighter and beat the other six in turn, champion last. Some fights come with a twist, and the champion gets a second wind. Easy, Normal or Hard.\n\n\ud83d\udcaa TRAIN BETWEEN FIGHTS\nAfter every win, the training camp opens with your fighter's next drill. Earn points to raise his Power, Toughness, Energy, Focus and Recovery.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 SIX VENUES\nA factory, a backyard, a beach cove, a volcano, a rainy city rooftop and a space station in orbit.\n\n\ud83d\udca5 HITS THAT SHOW\nHard strikes feel and sound different from slaps. Fighters bruise, cut and bleed.\n\n\ud83d\udc55 MAKE IT YOURS\nChange your fighter's face, body and outfit, and unlock new colours by climbing the ladder.\n\n\ud83c\udfb5 A new song every fight.\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f COMFORT\nSmooth walking and snap turning. Built for Quest 2, 3 and 3S.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f EARLY ACCESS\nExpect new moves, fighters and fixes with every update.", "short_description": "Step into the underground. \ud83e\udd4a Pick one of seven fighters, climb the ladder to the champion and train between fights to make him stronger. Throw real punches, fire off roundhouse kicks and use each fighter's own power: guns, swords, a bow, magic, rage and more. Fight across six venues, from a factory floor to a space station. \ud83d\udca5 A single-player VR brawler. Early Access."}]}, "developer_name": "CD", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fistsandfablevr.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fistsandfablevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags":